{"id":276377794,"title":"252 .express路由系统-静态资源部署-koa和中间件","summary":"express-express路由系统的使用（掌握）具体一点的用户接口是要加id的，创建用户的话是用post这样写是不利于项目的管理的","content":"<p>express-express路由系统的使用（<font style=\"color:#DF2A3F;\">掌握</font>）</p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783149561270-d5c2ccdb-c4e5-42aa-9dbd-5c1f9892059d.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>具体一点的用户接口是要加id的，创建用户的话是用post</p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783162445120-2262b846-4abd-47be-b5be-6696437e1411.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>这样写是不利于项目的管理的<img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783162985048-7cd18353-6752-4e11-a8ad-8b498a5da56d.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783163021308-62896a07-eb26-4bee-ab46-36265b60c7d9.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>相当于把userRouter作为一个中间件，传入给我们app，而userRouter要匹配的是/users</p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783163080359-2d60158c-cacf-4b87-b881-d9d30132d2d0.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783163178810-20a4eb7b-153f-439f-8fe2-cda75b025b56.png\" alt=\"\">变为这样写了。</p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783163261912-530c6c38-b935-4167-8c8d-b1e407f5db1b.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>我们把他单独放在一个文件里<img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783163396963-929336b3-65af-4d74-9a19-c8ea498ec42f.png\" alt=\"\"><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783163382482-4b91b46e-4d4f-49a2-8835-be39a6b8eff9.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>我们单独开来了之后要把他引入进来，才可以使用他<img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783163430158-dad06f3b-edbe-434c-8533-0ae905484439.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783163894166-faa8f622-d5ec-4c92-a544-5a5b69969102.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>express-express部署静态资源的服务器（<font style=\"color:#DF2A3F;\">掌握</font>）</p>\n<p>这样写的话，我们也是可以去访问到我们的图片的，以静态资源的方式<img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783171800499-b8ff0c1d-d0bb-4063-a9d5-2ba85b702d5c.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783171994550-51dacb04-da99-4524-801a-8d851c5241f1.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>服务器-服务器返回错误信息的两种方案（<font style=\"color:#DF2A3F;\">掌握</font>）</p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783172089735-2f3e0408-8fd2-4cef-b8f5-ed35735f6222.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783172100370-11993384-7ab6-4c49-a5b0-69a2a70ea06d.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783172407766-8a56bd7d-e932-440b-b184-bb874cbb2145.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>express-express中错误信息处理方案（<font style=\"color:#DF2A3F;\">掌握</font>）</p>\n<p>我们先写一个错误的（密码）</p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783173001698-4e8bd37b-4e74-4363-80f3-096ef038ccc0.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783172960483-e16e231a-7670-43c5-8965-9a2d2512fa51.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783172969656-19251f9c-4bd0-46c1-99c3-b452a6857ae2.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>这里next(err)!我们不用这个的话，他就会去赵其他的中间件，而不是我们本身是负责错误的中间件。<img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783173147223-58dad51e-92ed-4b4a-9feb-91d797a9fa43.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>当我们有多个错误码时<img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783173272278-93fe1728-08b5-40be-a9df-3ec34229c3cd.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783173317314-6dda7e91-0af2-4439-abaa-de34e2ef8d0a.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>express-</p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783173494398-870bc627-5972-455c-b126-c617baaecea8.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783173527847-2b22bd58-95a6-43c7-8daf-eb3f07aa610f.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>koa-koa的框架介绍和基本使用过程（<font style=\"color:#DF2A3F;\">掌握</font>）</p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783173678304-ff6a8b3a-df30-45fe-b816-6f5a507c8a4f.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783174328949-d26356d1-2864-4b52-bd70-3c9bce529d68.png\" alt=\"\"> </p>\n<p>我们要使用他，就得先安装他<img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783174383980-d9fadb82-94d6-4546-95e5-d3d732f41163.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>后面再写clear，然后再<img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783174428773-346eaf53-cc77-41c2-87b1-2c49eceb1955.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>因为我们的这个文件是讲这个框架的，所以我们下载之前要先进去这个文件。<img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783174501469-df6c1abd-60da-4463-85de-b8cb65cc8d3a.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783175659614-d895f75e-3c50-4b05-b028-68c0be7fa57c.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>koa-koa中间件的ctx参数解析（<font style=\"color:#DF2A3F;\">掌握</font>）</p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783176370056-8377a808-506b-480e-8b9b-17b870ea376c.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783176357906-2a920559-7d09-4895-9e2e-3a6a12294089.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>我们要单独拿个请求或者响应的话</p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783176484482-02bed036-6489-4744-ab04-44607dbe0182.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783176653208-88ff29ca-7e70-4ecb-8b92-e31060bf3305.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>koa-koa手动区分路径和方法（<font style=\"color:#DF2A3F;\">掌握</font>）</p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783176843275-ac94cf21-0675-4fc4-ac8f-75cf07135b46.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>他的next和express的是一样的。</p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783176894413-c36f949e-4ae6-4873-a9b6-6816f64a0bd8.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783176937972-b70cd476-ec3d-4a75-a749-b440c1e54907.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>他的use(里面不能写路径)</p>\n<p>这两个的结果宿舍一样的，我们获取路径有这两个方法<img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783177038564-a8ec7fdd-d54b-4728-8ac7-aac5ba2a77f5.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783177373189-073751ca-3ee6-4a25-a2a2-0b85802638f6.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783177379032-317a9d0a-d678-44fe-8ef7-3e4b52ad87b7.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>koa-koa</p>\n<p>我们要先安装这个koa的路由<img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783177587704-64dd5274-373e-4902-9cef-ff02c81cd218.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783177985358-89a91026-a800-406e-bc9d-a80fe3e89ede.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783177974178-29be0b0f-b64d-49c3-b2c5-aa9b55caec23.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>当我们没有封装一些方法的话，他在postman那里又send了</p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783178086620-4f9c32ba-1377-4952-9268-db177d987e7f.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783178099132-d4310f54-c682-4efd-9911-26613a7ec08a.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>koa-koa路由的安装和使用过程（<font style=\"color:#DF2A3F;\">掌握</font>）</p>\n<p>我们要单独放这个</p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783178380377-caaf4879-f813-4a04-8888-cf81eadbbebc.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783178399178-4e2d9e20-11b4-4ec4-ad9f-6aa4eca9d1ba.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>要用的话，就导入<img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783178425385-5e720e96-9751-473f-9662-c824bb96bd3e.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>koa-koa解析客户端传递的五种参数（<font style=\"color:#DF2A3F;\">掌握</font>）</p>\n<p>这个是我们koa的一个基本代码--做成片段。</p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783178734523-55ca233c-01e0-41e1-9b94-f3f6b6ee3071.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783178779783-51c21d4f-c0b5-4b71-b226-2fc4f13b42cc.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783178805779-ca098861-198e-4918-8910-85b10b0cc162.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>也是在后面加上<img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783178825430-62d1acc5-20be-4f68-8807-80780e77a38b.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783178981193-793164e1-7ab9-441f-aee3-2d88bdf7cbcf.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783178969652-dbd66c2a-9089-40af-abce-4acf26b48682.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783179038360-2e5f41d3-58dd-4476-86e2-dad7b1551d55.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783179022597-370f9670-2627-4d96-a4b6-8707804053e4.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783179296351-0b6dbaea-6644-4128-8021-3be94b96690a.png\" alt=\"\"> </p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783179332934-9604320a-e63b-44ca-abec-c7c6bad26333.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>我们无法解析body数据，对于这个，我们要安装koa的第三方库</p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783179353263-5a730fa4-ddc0-45dc-ae1e-30d69d5eef0b.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783179092353-a25b7c82-abbf-4622-8b88-62113fc614c9.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783179418448-d5401b20-0c02-4d9a-aabb-d4b7a4b2b602.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783179463819-c42dd76b-94d5-49f6-a721-502ae4b04e26.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783179426353-2790d576-f2cd-40ff-bf34-06276108cc57.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>现在就可以出现了<img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783179436673-3b9bee5f-f7f7-4c7b-b9ff-9a4089c74a09.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783179504934-3fdff531-ddee-4e84-9b91-7a9f91a14a67.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783179567072-2e3cdd58-6f40-45aa-91a6-1fb59fe1dd21.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783179576461-d8dffc51-645d-4015-a452-c2f949f74dff.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783179591076-34493de6-55fd-4a18-88c1-2a700b51980d.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>我们这样写，但是控制台没有数据输出<img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783179890613-595e4e9a-f975-4f36-89e1-3e4aec16ad7d.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>安装第三方库<img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783179683462-cbfc3b86-3472-43c1-8d79-b1b0b821c573.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783179955112-637d0e4e-e65f-4f70-923b-6c1176329647.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>表单的话，我们要单独对他做解析<img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783179990976-3b92475c-1769-48df-9271-1cafbcdb7174.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783180011684-7e0a00d0-7c0f-4cac-81a7-42573c5499e7.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>koa-koa文件上传处理方案（<font style=\"color:#DF2A3F;\">掌握</font>）</p>\n<p>这个代码自己帮我们创建文件<img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783180368011-89bb345f-dd67-49ad-ac8a-196015f410b4.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783180403152-8416a4dd-509d-41e7-be36-f150db4ca960.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783180419916-48924262-cf4a-4162-9789-f83d0e977f0a.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>我们的文件信息放在这里<img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783180453233-47524ab7-7069-43ff-906a-9a6569fc423f.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783180511501-45cdb009-5099-4a24-83f0-cf8b1f8f6824.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>这样的话我们的文件就有名字了<img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783180536028-f1cd2c34-c1d9-4545-b777-7479e7b3e40c.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>多文件上传--files<img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783180797240-9c04a030-f434-466c-b14e-a964d7a87710.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783180817330-243ddf64-70ea-481f-9fb2-a3fd9275037c.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783180834521-d4c9e9fa-7a06-4606-b432-3050ad5ec3c7.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783180851737-00a5a3f0-e817-4bc0-a85c-12714064e940.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783222727252-027bcefa-033d-459f-a8b1-621af0016195.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783222795462-a08e301a-117c-4c0b-bfdb-c8aa97852a99.png\" alt=\"\"><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783222832465-829985ae-4c84-4c11-a952-03eec1ba126d.png\" alt=\"\"><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783222857370-6b7d0fd0-86af-4acd-b4d8-cd2070b59895.png\" alt=\"\"><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783222882987-8c97677e-12c2-48d8-8e84-fbd37db4e80a.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783222905154-99da9222-fb10-41d9-905f-1168ef851be0.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n","contentFormat":"markdown","source":"yuque","cover":"","category_id":80707835,"category":{"id":80707835,"name":"nodejs","description":""},"created_at":"2026-07-04T10:53:14.000Z","updated_at":"2026-07-05T03:42:48.000Z","view_count":0,"like_count":0,"is_top":0,"is_featured":0,"tags":[],"status":"published","yuqueUrl":"https://www.yuque.com/woyaoyizhishuidajue/hkk7kv/vqkyq1ipzrirhck9","slug":"vqkyq1ipzrirhck9","wordCount":668}